      "questionType": "FillBlank",
      "questionText": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"248\"><strong>Choose the correct word from the box to fill in each blank. You can change the form of the word if necessary.&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100.03%;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"10\" cellpadding=\"10\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 24.7144%; text-align: center;\"><strong>community</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 24.7144%; text-align: center;\"><strong>consist</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 24.7144%; text-align: center;\"><strong>come</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 24.7144%; text-align: center;\"><strong>common language</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"248\"><br>English has become a <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.1</label><input id='fbo-906086-0' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='0' name='fbo-906086-0' type='text' size='18' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-906086-0' /></span></strong>&nbsp;for people around the world. It helps people from different countries communicate with each other. In many places, people use English as a way to share ideas, especially in business, education, and travel.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"250\" data-end=\"501\">Many countries have a large <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.2</label><input id='fbo-906086-1' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='1' name='fbo-906086-1' type='text' size='13' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-906086-1' /></span></strong> of English speakers. It <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.3</label><input id='fbo-906086-2' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='2' name='fbo-906086-2' type='text' size='9' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-906086-2' /></span> </strong>of&nbsp;people who speak English as a first language, such as in the UK and the US, and those who speak it as a second language, like in India or Singapore.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"801\" data-is-last-node>English has many different forms, and it<strong> <span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.4</label><input id='fbo-906086-3' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='3' name='fbo-906086-3' type='text' size='6' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-906086-3' /></span></strong> from many different countries. It started in England but has changed and developed in different ways as people in other countries started using it. Today, English is spoken in many parts of the world, and it continues to grow as a global language.</p>",
